---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import MeetJosh from "@/components/MeetJosh.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="eng team leadership"
  description="fractional engineering leader focusing on accelerating delivery, not cost">
  <div
    class="flex flex-col px-4 space-y-16 sm:space-y-32 items-center lg:pt-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl w-full px-4 lg:p-8 space-y-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold">
        Introducing <span class="text-orange-500">ELaaS</span>
        <small class="block text-xl text-orange-500 lg:ml-40">
          (Engineering Leadership as a Service)
        </small>
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-xl">
        Every tech team needs engineering direction. Some tech teams need to budget for a full-time engineering director. The other teams should reach out to me.
      </p>
      <div class="flex">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="rounded-md bg-orange-500 px-8 py-4 lg:py-3.5 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-50 shadow-xs hover:bg-orange-400 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-500">
          Get started
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div
        class="mx-auto grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-16 sm:gap-y-20 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-5">
        <h2
          class="col-span-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty sm:text-4xl">
          How a part-time director can help your team:
        </h2>
        <dl class="col-span-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold">
              <div
                class="mb-6 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500">
                <span role="img" aria-label="balance-scale">⚖️</span>
              </div>
              Align stakeholder goals
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-md text-gray-400">
              I translate company goals into clear engineering outcomes with
              measurable KPIs. I align founders, product, sales, and
              engineering through lightweight roadmaps, a simple RACI for
              ownership, and decision records so priorities stay visible and
              trade-offs are explicit.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold">
              <div
                class="mb-6 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500">
                <span role="img" aria-label="team">👥</span>
              </div>
              Coach founder teams
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-md text-gray-400">
              I mentor engineers and product-minded founders through lightweight
              processes that improve throughput &mdash; roadmapping, sprint
              rituals, incident playbooks, and decision logs. I also help with
              hiring loops, leveling, and onboarding so quality scales with
              headcount.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold">
              <div
                class="mb-6 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500">
                <span role="img" aria-label="hammer-and-wrench">🛠️</span>
              </div>
              Build for growth
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-md text-gray-400">
              I put reliable delivery foundations in place so teams move fast
              without breaking things: trunk-based development, CI/CD,
              infra-as-code, observability, performance budgets, and security
              basics. I favor modular designs that scale with your roadmap,
              not premature complexity.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold">
              <div
                class="mb-6 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500">
                <span role="img" aria-label="crystal-ball">🔮</span>
              </div>
              Plan for the future
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-md text-gray-400">
              I create runway-aware plans with milestones, budgets, and hiring
              steps tied to outcomes. From risk registers and compliance
              readiness to diligence materials for fundraising, you get a
              pragmatic plan that keeps you shipping today and de-risks what’s
              next.
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
        <h2
          class="col-span-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty sm:text-4xl">
          Clear technical guidance, clear pricing
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div
        class="isolate mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-md grid-cols-1 gap-y-8 sm:mt-20 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div
          class="lg:z-10 lg:rounded-b-none flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 inset-ring inset-ring-gray-200 xl:p-10 dark:bg-gray-800/50 dark:inset-ring-gray-700">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4">
              <h3
                class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-lg/8 font-semibold">
                Ongoing Tech Leadership
              </h3>
              <p
                class="rounded-full bg-orange-600/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs/5 font-semibold text-orange-600 dark:bg-orange-400/10 dark:text-orange-400 min-w-24">
                Most popular
              </p>
            </div>
            <ul
              role="list"
              class="min-h-48 mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm/6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                ✓ &nbsp; Ongoing guidance on key tech decisions
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                ✓ &nbsp; Project planning and oversight
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                ✓ &nbsp; 1:1 coaching for founding engineers
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                ✓ &nbsp; Hiring and onboarding support
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                ✓ &nbsp; Up to 10 hours of weekly support
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 lg:mt-12 flex items-baseline gap-x-1">
              <span class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
                $5k-$7k
              </span>
              <span
                class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                / month
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="bg-orange-600 text-white shadow-xs hover:bg-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-500 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:bg-orange-400 mt-8 block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm/6 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-orange-500">
            Get started
          </a>
        </div>
        <div
          class="-ml-px lg:rounded-l-none flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 inset-ring inset-ring-gray-200 lg:mt-8 xl:p-10 dark:bg-gray-800/50 dark:inset-ring-gray-700">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg/8 font-semibold">Custom Engagement</h3>
            </div>
            <ul
              role="list"
              class="min-h-48 mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm/6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                ✓ &nbsp; Design and build greenfield systems
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                ✓ &nbsp; Recruit and upskill your in-house team
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">✓ &nbsp; Automate manual workflows</li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">✓ &nbsp; Flexible support windows</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 flex items-baseline gap-x-1">
            <div class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
              Custom quote
            </div>
            <div
              class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Based on scope and timeline
            </div>
          </p>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="text-orange-600 inset-ring inset-ring-orange-200 hover:inset-ring-orange-300 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white dark:inset-ring-white/5 dark:hover:bg-white/20 dark:hover:inset-ring-white/5 dark:focus-visible:outline-white/75 mt-8 block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm/6 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-600">
            Get started
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <MeetJosh />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
